    "intro_html":  "\u003cp\u003eGreen chile, potato, and turkey, wrapped and ready. This build comes in at {{cal}} calories with {{protein}} grams of protein, on a tortilla carrying 18 grams of fiber for about 5 grams of net carb. We kept it a proper wrapped burrito with salsa rather than drowning it in sauce, so it holds up in the fridge and eats clean out of hand. Diced russet potato stretches the lean turkey and soaks up the green chile. If you like our Green Chile Ground Turkey Skillet, this is that flavor you can wrap and take with you.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "ingredients_display":  [
                                "\u003cstrong\u003eHigh Fiber Tortilla (La Banderita):\u003c/strong\u003e 14 tortillas (910 g)",
                                "\u003cstrong\u003e93/7 Ground Turkey (Jennie-O):\u003c/strong\u003e 3.5 lb (1582 g)",
                                "\u003cstrong\u003eOlive Oil:\u003c/strong\u003e 1.75 tsp (8 g)",
