    "make_it":  [
                    "Weigh your empty mixing pot and write the number down for portioning later.",
                    "Dice the russet potato small and the yellow onion and green bell pepper as well.",
                    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet and saute the onion and green bell pepper until they soften.",
                    "Add the ground turkey and cook, breaking it up, until browned, then stir in the ground cumin, garlic powder, and dried oregano.",
                    "Add the diced potato and the green chiles, cover, and cook until the potato is tender.",
                    "Stir in the salsa and warm through, then fold in the Mexican cheese blend so it melts.",
                    "Warm the tortillas so they roll without cracking, then fill and wrap each one."
                ],
